#Key terms — write your own definition after reading:
Term
Your definition (In your own words)
## Randomized controlled trial (RCT)
A study design that has a treatment(s) group and a control group. Participants are randomly assigned to a group. 
##Treatment effect
The treatment group’s measurable outcome. 
##Skill compression
##Task completion time
Amount of time it took to complete time
##Output quality assessment
Assessing the quality of output produced by humans or AI tools.
##Jagged technological frontier	
A concept that describes AI reliability in completing “equally difficult” tasks. AI assistance improves human performance only for tasks within current AI capabilities within the jagged technological frontier and worsens human performance outside of it.
##Centaur collaboration	
Type of collaboration between humans and AI. There is a division of labor where humans and AI tools work on different tasks, based on their respective strengths. 
##Cyborg collaboration	
Type of collaboration between humans and AI. Humans and AI tools work together on the same task together. Human interacts with the AI tool constantly until they reach their desired output.
##Over-reliance	
Relying on AI to perform tasks completely. 
##Inside-frontier task	
AI assistance can improve human performance if the task falls inside the frontier
##Outside-frontier task	
AI assistance can degrade human performance if the task falls outside the frontier

